3' end: 1, 4, 5 ,9, 10, 13, 16 , 17 , 21, 22
I have found a repeated pattern before the start of the telomeric region at the 3' end.
	- Chromosomes  1, 4, 17, 21, 22  pattern is "GTCGCAACTCAAATGCAGCATTCCTAATGCACACATGACACCCAAAATATAACAGACATATTACTCATGGAGGG".
	- Chromosomes 5,10, 16 pattern is: "AAATGCAGCATTCCTAATGCACACATGACACCCTAAATATAACAGGCATATTACTCATGGAGGG"
		- There is a shorter version of this pattern( "ACATGACACCCTAAATATAACAGGCATATTACTCATGGAGGG" ) which is shared with 5, 9, 10, 13, 16.




